wcw07974@uxa.cso.uiuc.edu (Bill Wendling) writes:

>I guess the title says it all.  What are magic Markers and how do you
>use them?  Also, what is it that is written in the dirt in this game?
>It says something like 'ad ae ne ao?'  What does it mean?

magic marker: apply on blank paper, and write then the name of a
              scroll you have already read.
              For example: "enchant weapon" etc.

'ad ae ne ao' should be 'ad ae ar um' which means:
						'ad aerarium' == to the treasure room

Search and you will find a teleporter to a treasure room.
But you should be able to teleport or dig to get out again.
Otherwise you will lose all your money if the guard comes...
If you tell him you are 'Croesus' he will come later again.
(Important if you have only teleport ability but not control.)

